    "question": "Mitzel spent 35% of her allowance. If she spent $14, how much money is left in her allowance?",
    "gold": "26",
    "answer": "If 35% represents 14, then 100-35 = 65 represents the amount left of her allowance.\nThe amount she didn't use is 65*14/35 = <<65*14/35=26>>26\n#### 26"
  },
